[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701095578","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103629#issuecomment-2701095578","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103629","id":2701095578,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g_3Ka","user":{"login":"and-rad","id":8700280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MDAyODA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8700280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/and-rad","html_url":"https://github.com/and-rad","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/and-rad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/and-rad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/and-rad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/and-rad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/and-rad/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/and-rad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/and-rad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/and-rad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/and-rad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T14:24:21Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T14:24:21Z","body":"It's a result of #86809. I also have to say that the ghosting is noticeable now and the blurriness is extremely noticeable. I think a proper set of config parameters for TAA need to be exposed going forward because as it stands now, the loss of image clarity is too much of a downside.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701095578/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702287622","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103629#issuecomment-2702287622","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103629","id":2702287622,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hEaMG","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T23:11:33Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T23:11:33Z","body":"Why close? It sounds like at least with default settings, there's a loss in quality which wasn't anticipated in #86809, so that may qualify as a bug (rendering maintainers will judge).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702287622/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702349459","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103629#issuecomment-2702349459","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103629","id":2702349459,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hEpST","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T23:59:19Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T23:59:19Z","body":"I suspect the solution here is to allow disabling motion vectors for things like the full screen quad (possibly with a render mode like in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/77523).\n\nIn 4.3 the full screen quad trick wasn't an issue because we rejected all previous samples in motion anyway. But now it's possible to overwrite the motion vectors and truly break TAA","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702349459/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2703306965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103629#issuecomment-2703306965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103629","id":2703306965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hITDV","user":{"login":"jijigri","id":616879