r_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T22:47:59Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T22:47:59Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.5.beta 9b22b4153 (Linux):\n\n4.4.dev1 (flickers back and forth) | 4.4.dev2 (stable but blurry)\n-|-\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df4fc805-191a-4448-80de-ea2b51790064) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f2752638-465a-4ce1-a2a9-efda284d5982)\n\nI bisected the regression to 7f1863f83d.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3033886277/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3036888850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103629#issuecomment-3036888850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103629","id":3036888850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61Az8S","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-04T17:01:15Z","updated_at":"2025-07-04T17:01:15Z","body":"@Calinou see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103629#issuecomment-2701095578 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103629#issuecomment-2702349459 above.\n\nThis issue is caused by the full screen quad overwriting the motion vectors. Prior to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/86809 that was fine because we ignored the MVs anyway and always rejected previous frame samples. Take a look at the MRP with the motion vector debug view enabled and you will see what I mean","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3036888850/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3072983211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103629#issuecomment-3072983211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103629","id":3072983211,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63KgCr","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-15T10:00:26Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T10:00:26Z","body":"@clayjohn After reading the issue, your PR, and Embyrdev's original PR ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/77523 ), i feel like a render mode to disable write for motion vector is indeed necessary, unless we have a way of reading scene motion vectors per-object and rewrite them as-is. Full screen quads sometimes are fully \"opaque\", in the sense that they write on the whole screen some variation of the screen texture. I may be missing something, but i struggle to see alternatives to both a render mode to disable write, and a motion vector output.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3072983211/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3076428125","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103629#issuecomment-3076428125","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103629","id":3076428125,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63XpFd","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-16T01:28:38Z","updated_at":"2025-07-16T01:28:38Z","body":"@QbieShay transparent objects shouldn't be writing to the MV buffer. The bug here is that the full screen quad is getting added to the MV write pass despite reading from the screen texture. \n\n\nI do agree that some way of disabling MV writes is likely needed. But this particular case should work automatically without any changes  needed from users","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3076428125/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3077534430","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103629#issuecomment-3077534430","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103629","id":3077534430,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63b3Le","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-16T08:29:33Z","updated_at":"2025-07-16T08:29:33Z","body":"@clayjohn Ah, apologies, i misunderstood. I have a couple of usecases in mind for that but we can discuss another moment.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3077534430/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]